      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In the past few months, I’ve seen people disconnecting frequently, often with more than 10 people in the same instance losing connection simultaneously. I’ve also been experiencing this issue more myself, even while using a robust router, a stable connection with low internal network traffic, 800mb bandwidth, and a high-end machine. This clearly shows that the problem is not on the client’s side, but rather with VRChat’s servers.\n\nIt doesn’t make sense for a company focused on a community-driven game to ignore such a large community like the Brazilian one.\n\nI hope they can give the proper attention to this issue, as it affects an entire community.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
