      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've also been having this quite a bit this year.\n\nI'm from the UK on 2 Gig fiber up and down. We monitor our own connection status and I can confirm there is no drops going on.\n\nThe process is the same as what people above me had said. People freeze in the instance then a message pops up with \"Connection was terminated by the host\" then I rejoin the instance fine. The 2nd and 3rd time the exact same thing happens and normally after the 3rd time VRC will just hard crash.",
