  "details": "My Experience:\n\nWe here in Brazil have been forced to use external resources or even endure absurd connection errors that come exclusively from VRChat. I play more than 30 different games and have no connection issues with any of them.\n\nDescription:\n\nHowever, for over three months now, VRChat has been experiencing an extremely frustrating issue that has even made me stop playing for a few days due to how annoying it is. Randomly, the game disconnects. My friends and I get disconnected in a way where we can still move and walk around the world, but everyone appears frozen. After a few seconds, everything speeds up, and then we can play normally again—until the next disconnect, which can happen anywhere between 1 hour and 2 minutes later.\n\nThis issue affects people from different regions and with different internet providers. In some cases, only a few players get disconnected while others remain in the world without any issues.\n\nWhen the game fails to reconnect properly, it kicks you from the instance and reconnects automatically.\n\nConclusion:\n\nThe number of people affected by this issue is not small, and I would really like to see a solution to such a bothersome problem. I love seeing VRChat grow and improve, and I hope this issue gets addressed soon.",
